Package: appusageR
Title: Parse and Validate Android Smartphone-Use Logs
Version: 0.3.9
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Kunru", "Song", email = "Kunrusong97@gmail.com",
             role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             comment = "Lead compiler and copyright holder of the bundled dictionary"),
      person("Xin", "Jin", role = "ctb",
             comment = "Assisted compilation of the bundled dictionary"),
      person("Changshu", "Zhang", role = "ctb",
             comment = "Assisted compilation of the bundled dictionary"))
Description: Parse, validate, standardize, and summarize exported 'APP Usage' and
    'Screen Time' Android smartphone-use logs. Provides resumable per-file caches,
    memory-aware parallel workflows, quality-control summaries, and project-level
    self-report matching. Optional application classification uses an independently
    versioned manual dictionary, retains ambiguous matches for review, and updates
    category annotations without recomputing upstream scientific data.
